    "title": "THE LAZY BERKSHIRE GARDENER: Week of January 1, 2025 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jodi Cahillane ,\n15 minutes ago I love this time of year. There is time and mental space to think about what you wish to grow and why. I spend time staring out at the landscape and can call it productive. Resolve this year to be a more conscientious caretaker of plants and your immediate environment. Take the time now to make plans. And maybe spread that energy and resolve to help others take care of our larger environment as the year unfolds. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
